# NOTE: archive/ is deliberately NOT ignored.
# It is the complete captured copy of the original litextextile.wordpress.com site
# (23 pages, 6 PDF catalogs, 46 images — ~42 MB) and is the source material the new
# site is built from. Versioning it is intentional: it makes every spec figure
# traceable and survives the original site being changed or taken down.
# Do not add it here. See archive/README.md.

